==============================================================================================================
(b) Learned weights, prequential in commit-date order: review with the current omegas, then the label
==============================================================================================================
  Structure: with three seats the weighted vote differs from the majority only if a lone dissenter's
  omega exceeds the other two combined (LOGIC; SECURITY, theta +0.2: a lone REJECT needs 2/3 of their sum).
  A REJECT boundary needs the rejecting seats' omegas to sum to 1.797 with no APPROVE in between;
  an APPROVE boundary needs 2.947, more than three seats at omega < 0.982 can give.
