==============================================================================================================
(d) 'Use the probability' (IDEAS.md): each seat adds its log-odds instead of a fixed LLR
==============================================================================================================
  Lambda += omega * log((1-p)/p) (WaRF's sign: positive = APPROVE). 'sum': every seat adds, no SPRT,
  decision APPROVE iff the omega-weighted mean log-odds >= theta (the synthesis rule with log-odds for votes).
  'early': WaRF's boundaries A, B on the same Lambda, early stopping on, every seat order.

  raw log-odds, uniform omega, early stopping on: SPRT verdicts per order [17, 17, 16, 18, 16, 18], mean agents asked 2.96; bal.acc mean 0.580 (range 0.580 to 0.580); AUC of -Lambda mean 0.733 (range 0.732 to 0.734)

