(e) Positive control: LAYA replaced by a synthetic seat with independent signal (AUC 0.70 expected)
==============================================================================================================
  SYN: score s = +/-0.371 (later fixed / never fixed) + N(0, 1), independent of everything else;
  p = sigmoid(0.742 * s), its exact posterior (calibrated); votes REJECT iff s > 0. 500 draws.
  SYN realised AUC mean 0.696 [0.587, 0.806], vote bal.acc mean 0.641; within-label correlation with JEV -0.008, with CLAUDE +0.004 (JEV-CLAUDE: +0.527)
